    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6af55182b11910.27508275\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">Restoration Druids have gotten a change to Wild Growth today in WoW: Forever.<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a class=\"wh-button zam-button\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/restoration/overview-pve-healer\" data-style=\"cta\" data-variation=\"undefined\"><span class=\"wh-button-text body-text zam-button-text\" data-text-style=\"body-small-bold\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Restoration Druid Guide</span></a></div><br><br>In a hotfix today, Restoration Druids got a few changes to <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/spell=408120/wild-growth\" class=\"icontiny\" data-entity=\"spell\" data-entity-has-icon=\"true\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_druid_flourish.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Wild Growth</span></a>, the capstone talent in their tree.<div class=\"quote-box exclude-units\" data-type=\"user\" data-has-source=\"false\"><div class=\"quote-header\"></div><div class=\"quote-body\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>Wild Growth</b><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Can no longer be cast while moving.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Spell power coefficient increased by 100% to 0.066 (was 0.033)</div></li></ul></div></div>It's unclear why Wild Growth could be cast while moving with the launch of WoW: Forever, but this is no longer the case. In its place, though, is Wild Growth getting double the spell power benefit, likely to help offset the nerf.</div>\n            \n            <noscript>Restoration Druids have gotten a change to Wild Growth today in WoW: Forever.<br /><br />Restoration Druid Guide<br /><br />In a hotfix today, Restoration Druids got a few changes to <a href=\"/forever/spell=408120/wild-growth\">Wild Growth</a>, the capstone talent in their tree. <br /><br /><div class=\"quote-box\"><b>Wild Growth</b><br /><ul><li>Can no longer be cast while moving.</li><li>Spell power coefficient increased by 100% to 0.066 (was 0.033)</li></ul></div><br /><br />It's unclear why Wild Growth could be cast while moving with the launch of WoW: Forever, but this is no longer the case. In its place, though, is Wild Growth getting double the spell power benefit, likely to help offset the nerf.</noscript>            \n        ",
